--cpp14
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ parameter type spelled with decltype of a previous parameter: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
